config EN7571
	tristate "Airoha EN7571 GPON Laser Transceiver"
	depends on I2C && HWMON && OF && GPIOLIB && NVMEM
	select REGULATOR
	help
	  Driver for the Airoha EN7571 GPON laser transceiver.
	  This driver handles the SFF-8472 digital diagnostic monitoring
	  interface (voltage, bias/modulation currents, optical power,
	  temperatures) and laser control (TX enable/disable, APD, RSSI).
	  The transmitter is driven through a GPIO pair and registered as
	  the "en7571-laser" regulator; the xPON half switches it through
	  that regulator.  Diagnostics are exposed through hwmon.
	  It also works with the an7552-gpon driver, which calls the few
	  remaining exported entry points (safe circuit reset, traffic
	  status, the MAC burst interface hook).

	  If unsure, say N.
